    "shortDescTitle": "<p>Surgical monitor mounting</p>\r\n",
    "shortDescTop": "<p>We offer solutions to mount HD and 4K flat panel monitors, including multiple monitors on a single mount, and we provide optimal cable management with a rear protective cover to secure and protect monitor cabling. Our customizable suspensions help ensure ideal placement of monitors in your OR so that your staff have optimal visualization when and where they need it.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
